      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 포켓몬들의 싸움에 휘말려서\n10발의 냉동빔을 동시에 맞은 거 있죠!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020C2F8C6C0C5D00020D718B9D0B824C11C000A00310030BC1CC7580020B0C9B3D9BE54C7440020B3D9C2DCC5D00020B9DEC7400020AC700020C788C8E0002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 불꽃타입인 둔타가\n이렇게 꽝꽝 얼어 버린 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020BD88AF43D0C0C785C7780020B454D0C0AC00000AC774B807AC8C0020AF5DAF5D0020C5BCC5B40020BC84B9B00020AC70C608C694002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "얼음상태치료제도 듣지 않아서 이제는\n강한 불꽃타입 기술로 녹이는 수밖에 없어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5BCC74CC0C1D0DCCE58B8CCC81CB3C40020B4E3C9C00020C54AC544C11C0020C774C81CB294000AAC15D55C0020BD88AF43D0C0C7850020AE30C220B85C0020B179C774B2940020C218BC16C5D00020C5C6C5B4C694002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드려요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n아주 강하고 뜨거운 불꽃타입 기술로\n둔타의 얼음을 녹여 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002100100001BE01000AC544C8FC0020AC15D558ACE00020B728AC70C6B40020BD88AF43D0C0C7850020AE30C220B85C000AB454D0C0C7580020C5BCC74CC7440020B179C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
